{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>華納雲成立於2015年，是擁有十餘年發展歷史的香港本土IDC服務商。作為APNIC和ARIN的正式會員單位，華納雲持有自有ASN號，並在中國香港、美國、新加坡、日本東京等地自營T3+級別機房，提供一手伺服器資源。其伺服器均採用知名品牌硬件，搭載Intel Xeon E5/Gold 6138處理器與SSD固態硬盤，能夠全面提升數據的傳輸與處理效率，顯著增強系統吞吐量，並有效降低請求處理延遲。</p>\n    <p>華納雲伺服器促銷套餐：</p>\n    <p>CN2伺服器/站羣/高防伺服器配置純CN2 GIA優質帶寬，並整合CN2、聯通9929、移動CMIN2三條精品線路，實現真正的三網直連骨幹網。路由路徑全程直連運營商核心節點，徹底告別傳統「國際混跑」帶寬常見的路由跳變、出口擁堵、多運營商資源爭搶等問題，從根本上消除了高延遲、丟包與網絡抖動。</p>\n    <p>1、CN2伺服器熱門套餐促銷：</p>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>CPU</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>內存</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>硬盤</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>帶寬</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>數據中心</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>價格(元/月)</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>購買</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>E5-2660</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>16G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>500G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>10M CN2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>中國香港</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>1200</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>Gold 6138</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>16G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>500G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>10M CN2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>中國香港</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>1400</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>E5-2660*2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>64G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>500G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>10M CN2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>中國香港</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>首月2400</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>E5-2650</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>16G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>500G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>50M CN2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>洛杉磯</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>800</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>E5-2680 V3*2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>32G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>500G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>50M CN2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>洛杉磯</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>1200</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>E5-2660</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>16G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>500G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>10M CN2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>新加坡</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>999</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n      <row>\n        <cell>\n          <p>E5-2660*2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>32G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>500G</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>10M CN2</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>新加坡</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>1199</p>\n        </cell>\n      </row>\n    </table>\n    <p>2、站羣伺服器熱門套餐促銷：</p>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"7\">\n        <cell>\n          <p>CPU</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>內存</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>帶寬</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>IP段</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>數據中心</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>價格(元/月)</p>\n        </cell>\n        <cell>\n          <p>購買</p>\n     