    </table>\n    <p>測試IPv4：</p>\n    <p>香港cn2：206.119.81.254</p>\n    <p>美國cn2：154.23.188.254</p>\n    <p>新加坡cn2：45.194.16.254</p>\n    <p>香港優化：154.39.66.8</p>\n    <p>日本優化：103.127.240.254</p>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T04:19:21.229075+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1460,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}